Z||000008||JetroGT||10-08-2001||08:06 AM||||Fix the wing!<BR>Take it off and flip it upside down. Set it on two blocks placed at the ends and set a brick in the middle. This works better in the summer heat. When it's reshaped fill it half way with spray foam insulation. Don't over fill it or you'll split the spoiler. It's worth a try.||||reg||14
